      "control_description": "IAM policies using NotAction that allow IAM write actions (iam:PutRolePolicy, iam:CreateUser, iam:AttachRolePolicy) through the negative logic gap are a critical privilege escalation vector. The extractor resolves the effective permissions of NotAction policies and flags when dangerous IAM write actions fall through.\n",
